    {
      "id": "0pP5ZgbgeqKQA9AnBu7ZS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -755.21240234375,
      "y": -448.85546875,
      "width": 474.37994384765625,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 366570578,
      "version": 123,
      "versionNonce": 1070507410,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786137036708,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Question: Build a Dashboard Snapshot\nSchedules\n\nYou work for a company that enables enterprise\ncustomers to author and share dashboards. A\ndashboard is a collection of one or more\nvisualizations that are rendered from the\nresults of one or more queries.\n\nYour task is to extend the existing system to\nenable users to schedule dashboard snapshots\n(i.e. periodically emailing out PDF snapshots of\nthe fully-rendered dashboard with fresh data to\nsome group of subscribers).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "EFKI_0zY9k4Dr_ghVsqkc",
      "originalText": "Question: Build a Dashboard Snapshot Schedules\n\nYou work for a company that enables enterprise customers to author and share dashboards. A dashboard is a collection of one or more visualizations that are rendered from the results of one or more queries.\n\nYour task is to extend the existing system to enable users to schedule dashboard snapshots (i.e. periodically emailing out PDF snapshots of the fully-rendered dashboard with fresh data to some group of subscribers).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "lIuN7YnJnw1LtRpWJL5sr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -713.48974609375,
      "y": -69.671875,
      "width": 446.611328125,
      "height": 675,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1816924690,
      "version": 892,
      "versionNonce": 420870482,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786137036706,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Existing Functionality:\n- Author Dashboard\n\nFunctional Requirements:\n- Scheduling Dashboard Snapshots: flexible scheduling \n    - now: immediate, future: one time, recurring \n    - granularity of scheduling: standard Cron \n- Users can subscribe to dashboard \n- Periodically email PDF snapshots \n\n\nNon-functional Requirements:\n- High Availability & Eventually Consistent\n- Schedules run within 10s of the scheduled time\n- Fault Tolerant - some retries involved\n- Should support 100K schedules/second\n\n\n\n\nScale: \n- 1000 companies * 1000 Dev * 1000 * 10\n- P90: 1M customers \n- 10B schedules / day\n- 100,000 schedules/second\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Existing Functionality:\n- Author Dashboard\n\nFunctional Requirements:\n- Scheduling Dashboard Snapshots: flexible scheduling \n    - now: immediate, future: one time, recurring \n    - granularity of scheduling: standard Cron \n- Users can subscribe to dashboard \n- Periodically email PDF snapshots \n\n\nNon-functional Requirements:\n- High Availability & Eventually Consistent\n- Schedules run within 10s of the scheduled time\n- Fault Tolerant - some retries involved\n- Should support 100K schedules/second\n\n\n\n\nScale: \n- 1000 companies * 1000 Dev * 1000 * 10\n- P90: 1M customers \n- 10B schedules / day\n- 100,000 schedules/second\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "iKqU8WHdeEn0-sPX_QHyp",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -737.51318359375,
      "y": 596.26171875,
      "width": 672.041015625,
      "height": 450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 820248530,
      "version": 427,
      "versionNonce": 643726542,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786137036706,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Core Entities:\n- Task  \n- Job \n- Execution\n\n**existing**\n- Dashboard\n- Query\n- User\n- Subscription \n    id, dashboard, users\n\n\nAPI:\n\nscheduleDashboardSnapshot(url,  schedule - CRON expression, startDate, endDate)\nsubscribeDashboard(url)\nsendEmailsPDF(dashboardId)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Core Entities:\n- Task  \n- Job \n- Execution\n\n**existing**\n- Dashboard\n- Query\n- User\n- Subscription \n    id, dashboard, users\n\n\nAPI:\n\nscheduleDashboardSnapshot(url,  schedule - CRON expression, startDate, endDate)\nsubscribeDashboard(url)\nsendEmailsPDF(dashboardId)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "x4AhsRTqNDexT5cpv71bL",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 102.98291015625,
      "y": 601.2890625,
      "width": 646.92578125,
      "height": 610,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
